{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat","id":911713,"title":"Just for Fun: Donald Trump as every supernatural splat","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-10T09:31:49-07:00","id":911713,"title":"Just for Fun: Donald Trump as every supernatural splat","content":"In a spirit of light hearted fun lets see how we could fit Donald Trump into every single splat. I shall get the ball rolling. (I don't think it needs to be said, but feel free to present your own interpretations of splats I or someone else already did.)<br /> <br /> Lets make the WoD great again.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Vampire: Donald Trump is a Carthian Mekhet</b><br /> <br /> Mekhet you say? Not a Gangrel?<br /> <br /> Think about Donald Trump purely from the view of his prey, the political machine. He was always there, behind the scenes, a big name donor. But he was always a distant figure, a phone call at donation time and a bit later, he calls you for a favour. It's been years since you thought about him, then you blink, and suddenly he's right there, fangs around your throat.<br /> <br /> Trump's political campaign is The One You Didn't See.<br /> <br /> And yes, it's also the One You Can't Kill; but translating the Mekhet's sobriquet to politics works a lot better than the very physical Gangrel's in my opinion.<br /> <br /> As for the Carthians, it goes without saying. He's leading a populist revolt against the Republican establishment, he's a hugely successful rebel, and he's probably going to make a huge mess of everything if he ever becomes the establishment.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Mage: Donald Trump is a Mastigos Libertine</b><br /> <br /> As a Mastigos Donald Trump sees and exploits minds and flaws. For this version of Trump the theories that he is a master manipulator are completely true, but he also works on a grander scale: seeing and exploring the flaws in the Republican Party.<br /> <br /> As a Libertine\u2026 well. Viewed through the lenses of hubris \u201cHumanity is magical\u201d transforms from a celebration of sleeper cultures into \u201cmy sleeper culture is magical. Not those foreign sleepers\u201d.<br /> <br /> Democracy Seeks the Truth transforms from a belief in debate, consensus seeking, compromise and giving everyone a voice into naked populism. Whatever the people vote for must be true and moral, and with enough campaigning and propaganda they will vote for ME!<br /> <br /> Destroy the Followers of the Lie\u2026 Trump has a violent rhetoric, but the incumbent Democratic presidency is busy performing assassinations via drone... I'll just play this one safe and just say 2/3 is bad enough.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Geist: Donald Trump is a Stricken Paragon</b><br /> <br /> (Note: Paragon's are a homebrew archetype I wrote a long time ago. Short version, their thing is being community leaders \u2013 a politician fits nicely).<br /> <br /> They were dead. The American isolationists, the labour movement, the followers of the old ideas, they were all dead, killed by the neoliberal consensus. Politicians placed flowers on their graves in exchange for votes, and then they ignored the dead.<br /> <br /> Trump saw what no one else could, he saw the beauty and power in death. It was a superficial and patchwork vision, but it was enough. His words were sweet poison and the dead, so eager for anything with life's sweetness drunk deep. Trump bound them to him, he created an army of the dead and set forth to conquer the living.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Beast: Donald Trump is a Makara Tyrant</b><br /> <br /> The establishment politicians and hangers on are out of their depth. Why are people cheering for insults that cross the line? What are these memes on twitter? There's violence at political rallies?! We cannot survive in this environment!<br /> <br /> There was gold in the water, the promise of votes and power. Every step out to sea seemed small and inconsequential. A Democrat calls Republicans fundie creationists here. A Republican has lunch with Rush Limbaugh there. Pander to your base a little, got one small step further than the other guy, get a few extra votes, another drop of power. Walk further out to sea, don't notice the widening gulf between two Americas until the water closes over your head. And there's something else, something horrific, something native to these waters. It thrives in this environment, and you're in it's power now.<br /> <br /> The Heroes should have seen it coming. They should have warned us. But Heroes don't do that any more. Even as we struggles to swim back to shore they shout to swim deeper, swords drawn, attacking a Trump rally is a grand dramatic act. If it gives him more votes, Heroes rarely see the flaws in their own plan.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Genius: Donald Trump is a Director</b><br /> <br /> (I can't think of any strong leaning to one Catalyst or another. Though his petty grudges somewhat suggest a Neid).<br /> <br /> It should have been impossible because it is impossible. A political campaign based on obvious lies, obvious contradictions, bluster and with no actual policies, all targeting a demographic who traditionally had little political influence. It is impossible, but Donald Trump is a Genius, he could see what nobody else could see, a way to make it work beyond any politician's wildest dreams.<br /> <br /> And yet he is mad. He is driven by pathological ambition, and like most mad geniuses he is destined to see his own creation turn upon him. Maybe not yet, but soon, not later than after election day. He has built a Wondrous political campaign, but his own campaign and image will surely cripple him as president through all the enemies it makes. If he looses he will be unable to contain the response from his followers, and the genie is out the bottle. Not even Trump can predict what the Republican party will look like when the 2020 election comes around.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Princess: Donald Trump is a Grace of Mirrors</b><br /> <br /> Monumental ego: Check.<br /> <br /> Overly simplistic world-view: Check<br /> <br /> Grandiose promises with no strategy for fulfilment: Check.<br /> <br /> Probably will lead his followers into tragedy if no one stops him: Check<br /> <br /> Self editing memory and warped perceptions: Check<br /> <br /> Childish temper tantrums: Check.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Leviathan: Donald Trump is a Thalassan following the School of the Sun</b><br /> <br /> Beyond the realms of human knowledge are creatures so alien and terrible that to even understand their nature is to abandon all sanity. When they emerge from the Depth madness follows in their Wake.<br /> <br /> Donald Trump is one such creature. When the stars and political climate were right he emerged, towering over an unsuspecting political establishment. The success of his campaign is as incomprehensible as the non-ecludian architecture of R'lyeh. His very existence warped and deformed the political landscape until all of it orbited him. His campaign speaks to people through the primordial lizard brain, and when it does voters revert to the ideologies and interest groups of a bygone era. Even Trump's enemies are affected, and are dragged down to his level. Once unthinkable, violence now looms over the democratic process.<br /> <br /> Trump himself does not even need to do much. His existence and presence alone are enough. Wherever he goes, primordial chaos and savagery follow in his Wake.<br /> <br /> Vote Trumpulhu in 2016! Why settle for a lesser evil?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 06-16-2016, 08:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T10:10:43-07:00","id":911734,"title":"","content":"He is a Changeling Beast who has made the ultimate gamble: becoming President of America throght a very powerful ( and very foolish) spell of Wyrd Sorcery. He is convinced once he gets himself in the White House he will be in position to furfil his ultimate goal: turning America in one giant Freehold and building a giant wall in the Hedge to keep the Others away. <br /> <br /> To say this isn't going to end well is the understandment of the century.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 06-10-2016, 01:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T12:32:36-07:00","id":911819,"title":"","content":"Hunter: A member of the Barrett Commission kept aboard to act as a loud obnoxious target to draw vampire attention away from the important stuff that didn't realize what he was supposed to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T13:00:08-07:00","id":911831,"title":"","content":"Abyssal spawn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T13:59:24-07:00","id":911866,"title":"","content":"The Don isn't a Libertine. He's all Seer. Probably in a former Mammonite who moved to Hegemonic to climb the ladder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T14:19:48-07:00","id":911880,"title":"","content":"I just can't see Donald as a Seer. He's too arrogant to serve anyone, even gods.<br /> <br /> I was able to connect him very strongly to two of the Libertine Creeds. Could you do the same to the Seer's beleifs?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=911819#post911819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hunter: A member of the Barrett Commission kept aboard to act as a loud obnoxious target to draw vampire attention away from the important stuff that didn't realize what he was supposed to be.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know. A game where you play the Geniuses, Hunter Conspiracy, Mages, Mummies, or Leviathans who created Donald Trump as a pawn and are now frantically trying to get your hands back on the reigns would be a great game.<br /> <br /> I'd probably go for Genius myself. &quot;I have created a monster!&quot; is pure mad scientist in my book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 06-10-2016, 05:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T14:50:00-07:00","id":911911,"title":"","content":"<b>Donald Trump as a Mnemosyne.</b><br /> <br /> Let's see what fits for him. Manipulating people through hate? Craving and corrupting every luxury it receives? Is bound to ruin everything he touches?<br /> <br /> Check, Check, and <b>CHECK. </b>The only difference between Trump and other Mnemosyne is that he's VERY much out in the open, and too big or powerful for Princesses (I'm not counting Storms at the moment) to simply destroy and get it done with. They'd need to diffuse him and everything he's touched like a bomb with too many wires. He most definitely has the Confudendum (twisting senses and darkening minds, especially using the &quot;Scapegoat&quot; power) and Tentendum (exploitation of Vice, in this case it's bigotry or racism) lines of Calignes.<br /> <br /> Though unlikely, I could also see him as a Cataphractoi instead. Very little changes on him, except that he has the Umbra <b>Infectious Hate. </b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9750_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"453"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T15:59:48-07:00","id":911945,"title":"","content":"Donald Trump as an Iron master Elodoth.<br /> <br /> The donald is nothing if not a con artist, and what is a con artist if not a social predator that preys upon the weak, desperate, greedy and stupid among men?<br /> <br /> And make no mistake, this election is a sacerd hunt for Trump and his pack and what are they hunting you ask? Why the spirit of the American right wing itself. Don't be too surprised, after all he used to be a liberal who was friends with clinton... sure he uses racism to achieve his goals, as he did when trying to stop new york's native american tribes from getting gambling rights that would hurt his casnios, but he doesn't really believe any of it. See, Trump and his pack know their going to lose the election, and that's the plan, for when Trump loses his angry supporters aren't going to take that well and will, if all goes to plan, commit an act of domestic terrorism that outperforms OK city and the world trde center. The resulting backlash will discredit and destroy the right wing in america, weakning the it's spirit to the point where trump can finish it off... and that leads to phase two of the plan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T19:00:18-07:00","id":912040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat#post911713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Mage: Donald Trump is a Mastigos Libertine</b><br /> <br /> As a Mastigos Donald Trump sees and exploits minds and flaws. For this version of Trump the theories that he is a master manipulator are completely true, but he also works on a grander scale: seeing and exploring the flaws in the Republican Party.<br /> <br /> As a Libertine\u2026 well. Viewed through the lenses of hubris \u201cHumanity is magical\u201d transforms from a celebration of sleeper cultures into \u201cmy sleeper culture is magical. Not those foreign sleepers\u201d.<br /> <br /> Democracy Seeks the Truth transforms from a belief in debate, consensus seeking, compromise and giving everyone a voice into naked populism. Whatever the people vote for must be true and moral, and with enough campaigning and propaganda they will vote for ME!<br /> <br /> Destroy the Followers of the Lie\u2026 Trump has a violent rhetoric, but the incumbent Democratic presidency is busy performing assassinations via drone... I'll just play this one safe and just say 2/3 is bad enough.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is brilliant, and yet, not quite there. I'm not sure the Path pick is correct; I'm actually inclined towards Thyrsus. But Trump's Techne is definitely the Republican party. That he's a Libertine? That seems obvious to me. He's installing his own Symbol into the Supernal and it's called Trump.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T21:08:05-07:00","id":912070,"title":"","content":"Dhonal, Keeper of the Broken Monolith, is a Falcon-Headed Tef-Aabi guildmaster, in charge of an ambitious project to create a grand architecture to dam the Heka flow within the continental United States.<br /> Unfortunately, he's not been terribly good at keeping up with the times and doesn't quite grasp that America does not, in fact, have access to the slave army that would be required to bring his project to fruition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4968-mrbreaksit","name":"MrBreaksIt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T23:43:43-07:00","id":912125,"title":"","content":"I can't believe I didn't think of Tef-Aabi. I'm going to give that a full write up <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> the slave army part is brilliant.<br /> <br /> <b>Donald Trump is a Falcon-Headed Father of Idols</b><br /> <br /> Have you looked at Donald Trump's campaign and thought this guy's views are a bit... outdated? Have you wondered why a man who's life seems to be spent building grandiose towers and golf courses at the expense of good business sense would want to be a politician? How come someone someone running for candidacy of a very religious party didn't take the time to memorise a few bible quotes.<br /> <br /> Trump's doing a good job of hiding it, but he's a lot more outdated than anyone thinks. This Falcon Headed Mummy is leading a rushed, energetic, campaign for the presidency with one singular purpose. One key promise to the public that before all others he will fufill. A promise to give the public jobs, after all it's easy to give people jobs if you don't realize that modern people think jobs need to include wages.<br /> <br /> Seeing how the public reacts when Trump attempts to turn the unemployed into a slave army to build large pointless monuments will be... interesting.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=912040#post912040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is brilliant, and yet, not quite there. I'm not sure the Path pick is correct; I'm actually inclined towards Thyrsus.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm curious, why Thyrsus?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T15:10:44-07:00","id":912468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=912125#post912125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious, why Thyrsus?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mastigos feels too direct, oddly enough. I was at a lecture/talk thing recently where it was pointed out that Trump's polling leads are built off dominance bids. Mastigos are all about transgression and confrontation, but they're also about psychonautics and I feel that Trump breaks away from that a bit too hard. Whereas &quot;The Wall&quot; and &quot;I'm a deal maker&quot; sounds a lot like boundaries and intercession, and the pure <i>abandon</i> with which he goes at things seems more of an Ecstatic/Shaman kind of thing.<br /> <br /> Also, I tend to favor interpretations of Trump that help people recognize that he's genuinely seen as a positive thing by a not-insignificant group of people. Master Manipulator Mastigos gives a puppetmaster vibe, to me, whereas Thyrsus makes it more clear to me that he's actually just <i>cultivating</i> something that was already pretty rampant as is. (I mean, I know you said exploiting existing weaknesses, but these people would not see their xenophobia, etc. as weaknesses.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T15:55:10-07:00","id":912497,"title":"","content":"Very well argued.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=912468#post912468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I tend to favor interpretations of Trump that help people recognize that he's genuinely seen as a positive thing by a not-insignificant group of people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, me too, when we're talking about the real life Trump. For fictional Trumps it depends on the story I want to tell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-13T11:57:40-07:00","id":913558,"title":"","content":"Can we do Hillary Clinton next?<br /> <br /> Trump: As one of the Possessed, his Demon is one of Pride, but he has full dots in Pride, Lust, Greed, Wrath, and Envy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-13T12:37:07-07:00","id":913586,"title":"","content":"I don't know enough about Hillary, and she doesn't strike me as having such strongly defined traits to build of in the way Trump does.<br /> <br /> But if you have ideas, go for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-13T12:44:32-07:00","id":913591,"title":"","content":"Trumps as a Demon is definitely a Tempter, but I've no idea what his Incarnation would be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4968-mrbreaksit","name":"MrBreaksIt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-13T13:51:42-07:00","id":913636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=913586#post913586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know enough about Hillary, and she doesn't strike me as having such strongly defined traits to build of in the way Trump does.<br /> <br /> But if you have ideas, go for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well she does have one; utter resilience. Just look at her at the Benghazi hearings, and how she's divided between taking the repeated attacks seriously and being extremely annoyed at the amount of time wasted, as that is all that is happening (seriously, there's a reason BENGHAZI!!! is synonymous with hopeless flailing by alt-right conspiracy theorists).<br /> <br /> Thus, I submit <b>Hillary Clinton as an Invictus Venture.</b> For like a Lord, she is very much <i>not </i>an approachable leader-she is cold, stalwart, and aloof. These traits are all turned into strengths-she makes of herself an icon, rather than a goddess. Inhuman, because leaders aren't really expected to be human. Also, very good at turning the fact she's &quot;better than the competition&quot; into a benefit-everyone sees her as a representative as the Way Things Normally Are, and a bringer of sanity and order regardless of what kind of person she is-she's not the best, but she is the most reliable. Invictus, because really, those describe the Old Man when it wakes up, too.<br /> <br /> EDIT: She has a Bane, though-and a very large blood supply. Otherwise, there would be more than one picture of it going active.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://img.wonkette.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/hillary-vampire.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Face of Hunger ain't pretty, is it?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 06-13-2016, 05:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T13:33:28-07:00","id":915808,"title":"","content":"He's one of the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/820747-silly-fun-time-the-tiger-it-cannot-be-contained\">Beautiful People</a>, clearly. People can't get enough of that hairpiece.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oObL3Ajmr2Y\" target=\"_blank\">I'm Dexter Holland, and I approve of this message.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T17:50:57-07:00","id":915940,"title":"","content":"I'd go Werewolf for Hillary, but with a cold, cunning rage, instead of a hot fury.<br /> <br /> She's made many deals with spirits of Greed and Wall Street from the Court of Indulgence to finance her campaigning, and they expect results from her.<br /> <br /> Bill Clinton isn't just her husband, he's her pack totem manifesting in a human disguise.<br /> <br /> Bill's a spirit of Lust, one of the Wetnesses, aka the Titu.<br /> <br /> Hillary channels much of her rage into support for never ending wars, like Iraq, gaining the support of wrath spirits.<br /> <br /> She's in fact favoured by the entire the Court of Indulgence, except the Wetnesses, who don't like seeing Bill Clinton restrained from acting on his nature.<br /> <br /> She'd be one of the Ivory Claws, very old blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 06-16-2016, 08:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T20:23:24-07:00","id":915999,"title":"","content":"<b>Bernie Sanders</b>: Closely associated with the Union, but constantly beset by the big money of the Barrett Commission backers and under fire by the Cherion Group for his anti-business positions, nevermind the various monsters screaming to tear a chunk out of him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T07:48:55-07:00","id":916196,"title":"","content":"As far as Beast goes, I'd argue Trump is an Anakim - what people fear the most about him is that he may win, that there's a chance he won't be stopped. Tyrant all the way ofc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T09:07:58-07:00","id":916254,"title":"","content":"I don't know. I don't think people feel powerless, it looks like people are angry and energized to express that anger politically - be it on social media or protests.<br /> <br /> Giving Trump a Family is hard, becuase people all round seem angry rather than scared. But it definitely seems they're not scared because Trump has the capacity to win (no one reacted this way to, say, Mitt Romney or George Bush when it looked like they might win). My thought is that if anyone's truly scared it's the Republican establishment, and they're scared because Trump defies all their understanding of politics. They can run a great race, but suddenly they find themselves outside their environment, they're at sea and they can't swim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T09:31:12-07:00","id":916270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=916254#post916254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know. I don't think people feel powerless, it looks like people are angry and energized to express that anger politically - be it on social media or protests.<br /> <br /> Giving Trump a Family is hard, becuase people all round seem angry rather than scared. But it definitely seems they're not scared because Trump has the capacity to win (no one reacted this way to, say, Mitt Romney or George Bush when it looked like they might win). My thought is that if anyone's truly scared it's the Republican establishment, and they're scared because Trump defies all their understanding of politics. They can run a great race, but suddenly they find themselves outside their environment, they're at sea and they can't swim.</div> </div> </div> </div>When people say that Trump and his supporters are <i>xenophobic</i>, it's probably worth taking the word literally. Thus, I'd look at Eshmaki or Namtaru. (I don't have a good fix on how Beast works, yet, so I can't go with one or the other or any.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.thenation.com/article/why-trump-now-its-the-empire-stupid/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=233793277040432&amp;ev=PageView&amp;noscript=1\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.thenation.com/article/why-trump-now-its-the-empire-stupid/\" target=\"_blank\"> Page not found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.thenation.com/article/why-trump-now-its-the-empire-stupid/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.thenation.com/article/why-trump-now-its-the-empire-stupid/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The Nation Magazine </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T13:23:16-07:00","id":916395,"title":"","content":"If Donald made or encouraged xenophobia in his supporters then I would look at Eshmaki or Namtaru*. If you say the Republican establishment have been encouraging xenophobia and accidentely unleashed a monster, and that monster is Trump, then he's a Makara.<br /> <br /> Honestly, you could do either.<br /> <br /> * I would say that Trump himself is less xenophobic than many of his followers; but that makes sense. A Beast that represents the fear of foreigners need not himself be scared of foreigners. Just like an Makara is probably never scared of the ocean (unless there's a Leviathan around)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T13:39:20-07:00","id":916399,"title":"","content":"I believe it was Saturday Night Live where someone called Ted Cruz 'Fat Dracula.' I've never been able to hear about him without thinking about it. He would be perfect for the Lancea et Sanctum. A ventrue, I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T14:13:25-07:00","id":916415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=916399#post916399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe it was Saturday Night Live where someone called Ted Cruz 'Fat Dracula.' I've never been able to hear about him without thinking about it. He would be perfect for the Lancea et Sanctum. A ventrue, I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>With that face? Nosferatu for certain. <i>Backpfeifengesicht,</i> man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T14:23:07-07:00","id":916424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=916415#post916415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With that face? Nosferatu for certain. <i>Backpfeifengesicht,</i> man.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I was thinking that, especially given comments about him from other politicians who find him abhorrent, there is a surprisingly following of women who find him attractive. I figured Dominate might help to explain his debating skills, which even his rivals seem to appreciate.<br /> <br /> Having tracked down the quote, it was in response to a comment that the GOP has created a Frankenstein's monster in Donald Trump. It's sort of easy to see Trump as a Promethean created by a demiurge trying to make the perfect candidate and things not going exactly as planned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-17-2016, 05:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T17:47:52-07:00","id":916516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=915999#post915999\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Bernie Sanders</b>: Closely associated with the Union, but constantly beset by the big money of the Barrett Commission backers and under fire by the Cherion Group for his anti-business positions, nevermind the various monsters screaming to tear a chunk out of him.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Except, of course, for the thearchs that quietly run the DNC. They think he's <i>adorable.</i><br /> <br /> (I won't go into this. Let's just say I'm <i>still </i>really bitter about my disillusionment with the man and the more nutcase contingent of his supporters. The Silver Ladder probably has the same exact opinion-but are too arrogant to take Trump seriously, because Silver Ladder).<br /> <br /> EDIT: (Oh, and by the way-the Democratic Party is not run by the Pentacle because the left wings are the good guys. They hijacked them as a reaction to the Seers of the Throne taking over the RNC, as evinced by the general lack of a spine-always a big motive for serving the Tyrants-among Republicans who endorsed Trump when trying desperately to both not disavow him and admit that yes, crowing victory in the wake of a massacre is generally not a sign of good things. Neither of the Pentacle sects are particularly happy about it, especially due to the internal tensions between Bernie's Libertines and Hillary's...Libertines. Mostly older Libertines who have fond memories of Obama. But yeah, the Free Council of DC has become rather <i>divided, </i>to say the least).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leli