ie is a Collapser, but he really belongs under whatever template Jesus is under, (probably Purified) with his goddamn &quot;care about others&quot;, &quot;help the poor&quot;, and &quot;birds land upon me as if nature itself supports me&quot; routine...</span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/873174-dragon-rekindled-the-orobori-chronicles-embers-reboot#post873174\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Dragon Rekindled: The Oroboroi Chronicles.</b></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#696969\">The official reboot of <b>Dragon: The Embers</b>.</span></span></span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10120-rockstarraccoon","name":"RockstarRaccoon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10120_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T06:47:17-07:00","id":917996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=912040#post912040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But Trump's Techne is definitely the Republican party.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thinking about this a bit more, Trump's Techne specifically <i>isn't</i> the Republican Party.<br /> <br /> It's deal making. Or specifically New York real estate market deal making. If you look at Trump, he talks like a salesman not a politician. How often does he say he's going to get &quot;the best people&quot; as though that answers the question of how he's going to impliment some vague policy idea. That's not a presidential candidate talking, that's a CEO.<br /> <br /> Trump is running for presidency. But he's treating it like another real estate venture to sell to people. In short, he's trying to replace political culture with New York real estate corporate culture. You could probably describe it as imperialism.<br /> <br /> That too is a sign of Libertine Hubris. Not automatically, sometimes cultures do genuinely need reform and bringing tried and tested ideas from other cultures is a sensible way to do it. But anytime a libertine (or Ladder) starts talking or acting like this, it's time to look twice and ask if they're talking wisdom or hubris.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13