&quot;care about others&quot;, &quot;help the poor&quot;, and &quot;birds land upon me as if nature itself supports me&quot; routine...</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, no.<br /> <br /> Given his supporter's recent behavior, he being the most sore of sore losers, inability to construct a coherent plan to save his life, he's a Fire-Touched. A Fire-Touched with a lot of self-awareness who genuinely wants to help humans by restoring respect for the long-neglected Dihir of Socialism, but like all Izidakh, he confuses &quot;good for me&quot; with &quot;good for Harmony&quot;. As evinced by the fact he let his spirit packmate, Egg-On-King's-Face, to run roughshod through his remaining supporters and making them think &quot;World's Largest Group Fart&quot; was at all a good way of protesting the winning candidate.<br /> <br /> (I so sincerely wish this was hyperbole. I can't link to it on a phone, but Google &quot;Bernie Fart-In&quot;. And people wonder why I suddenly became a member of the Clinton fan club..).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-20T15:37:13-07:00","id":918275,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>his spirit packmate, Egg-On-King's-Face</i> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://rebelmommybookblog.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/Hysterical-Laughing-Gif-12.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> Note: thanks to you I had to clean my laptop from coffee spat.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T01:26:05-07:00","id":918488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=916254#post916254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know. I don't think people feel powerless, it looks like people are angry and energized to express that anger politically - be it on social media or protests.</div> </div> </div> </div>And yet, pundits from all sides spend about as much time discussing why nothing they do seems to stop Trump's rise as they do actually hitting him with whatever they got. Overall, the amount of coverage Trump gets has less to do with his &quot;program&quot; (for a lack of better word) and more with how far he got in the race despite the incessant (and justified, more often than not) criticism from all directions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T01:52:41-07:00","id":918502,"title":"","content":"Unrelated: Assuming Trump won, would it be any different from Bush? <br /> I believed presidents these days were little more than faces to the public, allowing the actual puppeters ( senior members of the party, lobbies, corporations, etc...) to pull the strings (mostly) unnoticed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T02:09:41-07:00","id":918510,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raistlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=918502#post918502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unrelated: Assuming Trump won, would it be any different from Bush?<br /> I believed presidents these days were little more than faces to the public, allowing the actual puppeters ( senior members of the party, lobbies, corporations, etc...) to pull the strings (mostly) unnoticed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like this thread has gotten political enough without making it explicit. =/<br /> <br /> I mean, I could answer you, but there are dozens of well-thought-out, well-informed, well-argued opinions floating around on the internet that you could find anyways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T04:12:56-07:00","id":918544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=918488#post918488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And yet, pundits from all sides spend about as much time discussing why nothing they do seems to stop Trump's rise as they do actually hitting him with whatever they got. Overall, the amount of coverage Trump gets has less to do with his &quot;program&quot; (for a lack of better word) and more with how far he got in the race despite the incessant (and justified, more often than not) criticism from all directions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Still, that feels like the opposite of Anakim. You run from Anakim because you can't fight back, this is them fighting back and being scared that no weapon penetrates his orange hide. In Vampire terms, Anakim have Vigor, but Trump has Resliance.<br /> <br /> Maraka still seems more fitting. In the sense that Maraka are the fear of being out of your environment. In the political environment these attacks are effective. In Trump's environment they are not. Thus, being in the wrong environment is scary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T04:30:09-07:00","id":918553,"title":"","content":"Okay, now that I have a computer, <a href=\"http://www.truthdig.com/eartotheground/item/worlds_largest_fart-in_planned_for_hillary_clintons_acceptance_speech_in_ph#below\" target=\"_blank\">I can post to proof of the Fart-In.</a> <br /> <br /> I await what you make of it with baited breath.<br /> <br /> (another theory is that we need to check if the mage responsible for this is both a member of the Trump campaign and has a Shadow Name of Loki or something. If both, congrats on managing to pull off such a wide-scale mind spell, if not, well <i>someone's </i>never going to live down that Paradox).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T04:53:12-07:00","id":918560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=918544#post918544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still, that feels like the opposite of Anakim. You run from Anakim because you can't fight back, this is them fighting back and being scared that no weapon penetrates his orange hide. In Vampire terms, Anakim have Vigor, but Trump has Resliance.<br /> <br /> Maraka still seems more fitting. In the sense that Maraka are the fear of being out of your environment. In the political environment these attacks are effective. In Trump's environment they are not. Thus, being in the wrong environment is scary.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Powerless&quot; means both &quot;lacking power to act&quot; and &quot;unable to produce an effect&quot;. I'd argue both are equally in theme for the Anakim, and I'd posit that the latter is a pretty spot-on summation of most anti-Trump efforts to date.<br /> <br /> Really not seeing the Makara thing. It's Trump who's outside his environment, not everyone else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T06:32:18-07:00","id":918594,"title":"","content":"Trump might be outside his environment, but he's bringing his environment with him. Much like any Beast will do with their Lair Traits. Their environment might be the sea, but they can flood anywhere they like if it has Resonance.<br /> <br /> As for Anakim. I get your point, but everything in the way Anakim are written focuses on your inability to resist; not the Anakim being able to resist what you do to it. In fact, Relentless Hunter is Affinity for Eshmaki. (Which actually could work for Trump in the way the Mekhet did). So you're comparing a very non-typical Anakim to a fairly typical Makara. I have to give this one to Makara.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T08:38:20-07:00","id":919110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=918594#post918594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Trump might be outside his environment, but he's bringing his environment with him. Much like any Beast will do with their Lair Traits. Their environment might be the sea, but they can flood anywhere they like if it has Resonance.</div> </div> </div> </div>How is Trump bringing his environment with him? He actively touts his fish-out-of-water, &quot;I'm not a part of the establishment&quot; status, and he's running a fairly normal (in terms of form, not necessarily the content) presidential campaign - he does meetings, rallies, interviews, debates etc. like every other candidate. <br /> <br /> Also, where did you get this &quot;Makara as fear of being outside your element&quot; line in the first place? I've read their core writeup a couple of times now and am not seeing it. Literal fear of water/drowning, yes. Fear of secrets deep buried, sure. But extrapolating that the way you did feels like a huge stretch to me. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for Anakim. I get your point, but everything in the way Anakim are written focuses on your inability to resist; not the Anakim being able to resist what you do to it. In fact, Relentless Hunter is Affinity for Eshmaki. (Which actually could work for Trump in the way the Mekhet did). So you're comparing a very non-typical Anakim to a fairly typical Makara. I have to give this one to Makara. </div> </div> </div>One of the sample Anakim characters is a judge of fearsome repute. Do you think people just give up on defending themselves in his court? No, he just crushes their line of defense and delivers the punishment regardless of their efforts. Another Anakim is a safe cracker. The powerlessness he evokes lies in inability to make a safe that withstands his tender touch, but it doesn't exactly make people give up on making/buying safes, does it?<br /> <br /> Bringing this back to Trump, we're talking about the same thing viewed from two different perspectives - you see people rallying against him and throwing barrage after barrage of attacks (which does fuck all to his ratings), I see a guy who went from joke to dark horse to GOP nominee while (seemingly, at least) giving zero fucks about all the efforts to stop him. The end result is the same regardless of perspective.<br /> <br /> In terms of physics, unstoppable force and immovable object are the same thing. In terms of Beast, that thing is Anakim.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T11:49:02-07:00","id":919234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=919110#post919110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How is Trump bringing his environment with him? He actively touts his fish-out-of-water, &quot;I'm not a part of the establishment&quot; status, and he's running a fairly normal (in terms of form, not necessarily the content) presidential campaign - he does meetings, rallies, interviews, debates etc. like every other candidate.</div> </div> </div> </div>Trump's &quot;environment&quot; is one in which you win elections by using Trump's content (to borrow your word) while all the old political content is suddenly discovered to be useless.<br /> <br /> It is an environment where political violence is not unthinkable, but real.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=919110#post919110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, where did you get this &quot;Makara as fear of being outside your element&quot; line in the first place? I've read their core writeup a couple of times now and am not seeing it. Literal fear of water/drowning, yes. Fear of secrets deep buried, sure. But extrapolating that the way you did feels like a huge stretch to me.</div> </div> </div> </div> I got it from a post on the Beast forums, I thought made perfect sense. Sadly, I didn't save the link.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=919110#post919110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the sample Anakim characters is a judge of fearsome repute. Do you think people just give up on defending themselves in his court?</div> </div> </div> </div> Actually I think they do give up. Not instantly, but a lot sooner than they would against any mortal Judge. At some point they realise it's futile to argue back and then they give up.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile Trump's won the primaries, and people are still talking about trying to undo him in an underhanded way.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=919110#post919110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In terms of physics, unstoppable force and immovable object are the same thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>In terms of myths, they're different things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> 