"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Bernie Sanders</b>: Closely associated with the Union, but constantly beset by the big money of the Barrett Commission backers and under fire by the Cherion Group for his anti-business positions, nevermind the various monsters screaming to tear a chunk out of him.</div> </div> </div> </div> I like this one so much I endorse it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T09:14:02-07:00","id":920399,"title":"","content":"If Hillary was a Mage instead of a Werewolf, she'd be Seers of the Throne, backed By a Seers of the Throne DNC. Bernie would be an alliance of Silver Ladder and Libertines.<br /> <br /> Trump's a business man, and thinks like that x10, so I still think he's best represented as one of the Infernally possessed.<br /> <br /> Giving this thread a Canadian twist, Justin Trudeau is Hedgespun Automation with an absurdly high Charisma, Gerald Butts is the Seer of the Throne Athcanus who controls him, Mulcair is Father Wolf, and the old, tired and now sort of deposed pack leader of the First Born who got torn apart by his pack, Rona Ambrose, a Seer of the Throne from a Ministery competing with the Ministery running the Liberal Party.<br /> <br /> Elizabeth May is a Seer of the Throne for a very minor Ministery, that's tryinh to work its way up, associoted with an Exarch of the Life arcana, but which has been influtrated by another Ministry and which is used as a wing of the greater Ministery.<br /> <br /> The Bloc, is an Nameless Order of Banishers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T09:44:33-07:00","id":920419,"title":"","content":"All right, enough is enough. I'm going into my actual political beliefs here, such as my opinion that Bernie's losing campaign is a good sign that the party actually has a clue, and most of his diehard supporters (some of which are actually trolls who just want to hurt the<i> feeemale </i>candidate and couldn't give a rip about him) are the Democratic equivalent of the Tea Party. And just as self-sabotaging and dumb. I am not accusing anyone on this thread of being part of said Herbal Tea Party, but I will say that the more I have learned about Bernie Sanders, the more I have come to absolutely despise him and everything he stands for (that Clinton does not actually have as part of her platform).<br /> <br /> In Mage terms, Hillary is as Thearch as they come. In both positive (insightful) and negative (arrogant) senses. As well as the fact the Seers have spent years running a smear campaign that is intended to keep her safely away from any place that she might disrupt their power, intentionally or not. One item of Paternoster belief, that only the purest ideals are worthy of support, and anyone who actually believes in compromise is automatically a sell-out, was quietly inserted into the Sanders campaign after it proved to work so well in the RNC. The Ministry of Hegemon's side of things, that votes actually matter so little that staging a protest vote at actual elections is a good plan, hasn't gained as much traction, but as shown by their victory in Great Britain (you have my condolences, King's Raven, and anyone else British), it definitely has value in making Sleepers shoot themselves in the foot and keeping mankind divided. Yes, they don't have a referendum system here, yet, but they're getting there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 06-24-2016, 12:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T11:25:48-07:00","id":920461,"title":"","content":"A woman who's been the US Secretary of State has hardly been kept away from power. And a woman whose chief accomplishment in office has been to collect rivers of money through a tax-exempt foundation can't be honestly described as an idealist. Nor have I seen any examples of insight from Hillary Clinton, through there's a lot of arrogance. For all those reasons I would put her solidly in the Ministry of Mammon. Donald Trump, meanwhile, is a tool of the Hegemony, intended to sabotage the Mammon-Panopticon plan to build a worldwide technocracy.<br /> <br /> The Pentacle has been frozen out of American politics. They've got a few people, but none of them are in important positions. Look for the politicians the mainstream media call crackpots, extremists and radicals - <i>those</i> are the ones the Pentacle likes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1133-michael-brazier","name":"Michael Brazier","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T11:39:26-07:00","id":920469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael Brazier</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=920461#post920461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And a woman whose chief accomplishment in office has been to collect rivers of money through a tax-exempt foundation can't be honestly described as an idealist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Really, one has nothing to do with another. You can be an idealist whether you have no money or you've all the money in the world. But I don't think anyone's called her an idealist in this thread anyways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-24-2016, 02:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T11:48:31-07:00","id":920478,"title":"","content":"In Demon terms, Trump certainly isn't Unchained (being far too high profile, and obnoxious about it). While he may be an Angel (perhaps a Psychopomp), I think he's more likely just a stigmatic (or perhaps some sort of Cryptid, what with the hair and skin color) that the Machine has a blind spot against.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Hillary, in this case, is obviously a Messenger Angel. She's too much a tool/function of the establishment otherwise (and her pauses when lying are her checking back with Headquarters for instructions).<br /> <br /> Cruz is a Reptilian, full stop.<br /> <br /> Sanders is either an Exile, or an Unchained (Saboteur or Tempter, if not both) desperately trying to pretend to be one.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T12:29:26-07:00","id":920502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael Brazier</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=920461#post920461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Pentacle has been frozen out of American politics. They've got a few people, but none of them are in important positions. Look for the politicians the mainstream media call crackpots, extremists and radicals - <i>those</i> are the ones the Pentacle likes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which of those three does the mainstream media not use to describe Trump?<br /> <br /> For once I agree with everything you're saying MB - except that I put Trump as a Hubris ridden Libertine (reasons on page 1)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=920419#post920419\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> (you have my condolences, King's Raven, and anyone else British)</div> </div> </div> </div>It's probably going to be rough over here for a while, but I don't think it's going to be the apocolypse. We'll manage. Given how badly the EU managed the banking crisis and Greece's economic crisis I was already speculating that it's going to slowly fall apart. Keep an eye out on France, they've got an election next year and their approval ratings for the EU are even <i>lower</i> than ours.<br /> <br /> The bigger risk is us ending up like the USA and having a country so divided that people can't even understand the people on the other side. Brexit has thrown those divisions into sharp focus and hurt a lot of feelings - but it might also force people to start building bridges too.<br /> <br /> Anyway lets bring this back to the WoD. The EU is run by Thearchs who hubristically thought they could ignore any Sleeper disinterest in their one Europe project. Brexit was led by Libertines standing up for the right to democratically decided self determination and protecting their favoured culture from globalization, and hubristically thinking that if they focused on the principals the political details will sort themselves out. Cameron and the remain campaign might be a from Mammon though<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 06-24-2016, 03:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T13:08:19-07:00","id":920519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael Brazier</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=920461#post920461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A woman who's been the US Secretary of State has hardly been kept away from power. And a woman whose chief accomplishment in office has been to collect rivers of money through a tax-exempt foundation can't be honestly described as an idealist. Nor have I seen any examples of insight from Hillary Clinton, through there's a lot of arrogance. For all those reasons I would put her solidly in the Ministry of Mammon. Donald Trump, meanwhile, is a tool of the Hegemony, intended to sabotage the Mammon-Panopticon plan to build a worldwide technocracy.<br /> <br /> The Pentacle has been frozen out of American politics. They've got a few people, but none of them are in important positions. Look for the politicians the mainstream media call crackpots, extremists and radicals - <i>those</i> are the ones the Pentacle likes.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're assuming the Seers were highly competent. Given how they are prime examples of the horseshoe theory, I have my doubts.<br /> <br /> And I've looked at many of those cranks. Frankly, if people like Ted Bundy and Joe Arapio are people the Pentacle as a whole likes, they deserve to be locked out of politics. If you honestly believe there is no fundamental difference between the presumptive nominees, as was implied by &quot;joint plan&quot;, you need to actually listen to speeches. Or read credible news. Or both. Frankly, this election has proven to me that &quot;moral purity&quot; is code for &quot;complete, stubborn idiot.&quot;<br /> <br /> As a side note, the real reason we're even talking about Trump is the fake, limp-wristed &quot;neutrality&quot; that advises them to never call a crank a crank in the first place. Not without empty &quot;both sides!&quot; pseudo-balance. Which is probably why &quot;the veteran politician and the complete unknown quality/professional celebrity are the same person&quot; hasn't been shot in the skull by otherwise intelligent people.<br /> <br /> [/Generational Clinton fan rant]<br /> <br /> Back on topic, and back to the Brexit-could also be the result of the Ivory Claws scoring a major victory for the spirits of monarchy and purity of culture, especially given how powerful they're said to be in Shadows of the UK","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T13:38:02-07:00","id":920532,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=920519#post920519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Back on topic, and back to the Brexit-could also be the result of the Ivory Claws scoring a major victory for the spirits of monarchy and purity of culture, especially given how powerful they're said to be in Shadows of the UK</div> </div> </div> </div>Hah, good call.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T14:24:31-07:00","id":920563,"title":"","content":"Speaking as a Brit, Shadows of the UK always felt pretty weird to me. Just to give one example, the first opening theme is &quot;Scars&quot; - but if you look at the USA the entire country is still divided along the lines of the American Civil War, that's a scar. We don't have anything scars nearly as drastic as that. It's been a while since I read it so I'll leave it there.<br /> <br /> If I did Shadows of the UK I'd probably use multiculturalism as a theme. The problems and solutions faced when you've got Mage culture, Werewolf culture, Sin-Eater culture, all trying to live side by side. I'd make it significantly more political and significantly less violent to reflect the difference between American urban fantasy (e.g. Dresden Files), and British urban fantasy (Rivers of London, Londng Falling. Alex Verses and Kraken are somewhere in the middle, as though Dresden stayed on the level of the first few books rather than going for wars and apocalypses)<br /> <br /> Technically I did my own Shadows of the UK - read the Lord Stewards in Dream Catchers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 06-25-2016, 03:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T00:53:25-07:00","id":920868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=920519#post920519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I've looked at many of those cranks. Frankly, if people like Ted Bundy and Joe Arapio are people the Pentacle as a whole likes, they deserve to be locked out of politics.</div> </div> </div> </div>I forgot to respond to this bit.<br /> <br /> I think in the Mage setting where an actual evil conspiracy does dominate the world Ted Bundy and Joe Arapio are probably far better candidates than in the real world; but their real world image is what the Seers want you to think. Free your mind man <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T04:00:13-07:00","id":920902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=920868#post920868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I forgot to respond to this bit.<br /> <br /> I think in the Mage setting where an actual evil conspiracy does dominate the world Ted Bundy and Joe Arapio are probably far better candidates than in the real world; but their real world image is what the Seers want you to think. Free your mind man <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>...Nah.<br /> <br /> I think it's more horrifying if it turns out they act exactly like their media image-or at least, their real world image is based on real, and usually really bad, elements of their real selves. Maybe the Seers make them look even worse, but I don't feel like humanity should get off that easy and claim that all those horrible people are really just victims of The Man. Frankly, the underdog is one of those concepts that's so easily abused I've become skeptical of anyone claiming to be one; often, they're the overdog, but they're &quot;suffering&quot; things like taxes, or being told off for hate speech, or watching their neighbor benefit and them not getting a piece, or being fired for genuine incompetence, or...<br /> <br /> If I use your idea, I'd make it quite clear that they're completely unrelated to whatever stories the Seers are using to frame them, or are being abused by Profane Urims. Attempting to claim &quot;they aren't that bad&quot; when they do those things of their own free will strikes me as...<i>overly convenient, </i>to a relatively privileged heterosexual cisgender white man like me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T02:14:43-07:00","id":921410,"title":"","content":"In contrast I think it's pretty much required by the setting. If you assume that the establishment is the Seers and Exarchs' show then the Pentacle's favoured politicians by definition have to be those disliked by the mainstream.<br /> <br /> From there either: There basically aren't any politicians popular among the pentacle for one reason or another. The Pentacle genuinely likes people like Trump. The non-establishment politicians are better people in the WoD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T02:30:19-07:00","id":921412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=920419#post920419\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All right, enough is enough. I'm going into my actual political beliefs here, such as my opinion that Bernie's losing campaign is a good sign that the party actually has a clue, and most of his diehard supporters (some of which are actually trolls who just want to hurt the<i> feeemale </i>candidate and couldn't give a rip about him) are the Democratic equivalent of the Tea Party. And just as self-sabotaging and dumb. I am not accusing anyone on this thread of being part of said Herbal Tea Party, but I will say that the more I have learned about Bernie Sanders, the more I have come to absolutely despise him and everything he stands for (that Clinton does not actually have as part of her platform).<br /> <br /> In Mage terms, Hillary is as Thearch as they come. In both positive (insightful) and negative (arrogant) senses. As well as the fact the Seers have spent years running a smear campaign that is intended to keep her safely away from any place that she might disrupt their power, intentionally or not. One item of Paternoster belief, that only the purest ideals are worthy of support, and anyone who actually believes in compromise is automatically a sell-out, was quietly inserted into the Sanders campaign after it proved to work so well in the RNC. The Ministry of Hegemon's side of things, that votes actually matter so little that staging a protest vote at actual elections is a good plan, hasn't gained as much traction, but as shown by their victory in Great Britain (you have my condolences, King's Raven, and anyone else British), it definitely has value in making Sleepers shoot themselves in the foot and keeping mankind divided. Yes, they don't have a referendum system here, yet, but they're getting there.</div> </div> </div> </div> In my country I've voted for candiates of parties lead by women, effectively voting for a woman Prime Minister (Alexa McDonough of the NDP), as well as a Female Premier of my Province Ontario (Andrea Horwath of the NDP), and I even indirectly supported a female for of Toronto Olivia Chow, and was a cheerleader of sorts for Premier Rachel Notley of Alberta (I couldn't vote for Chow or Notley directly, but I did well make views of support public).<br /> <br /> I've also voted for women directly at the riding level.<br /> <br /> And if Ruth Ellen Brousseau tosses her hat into the ring as other are now speculating, which I supported long before it was cool and people thought it was crazy, I will vote for her to lead the NDP.<br /> <br /> But if I could vote in an America election I would never vote for Hillary Clinton, EVER I'd eat the ballot first. <br /> <br /> Hillary Clinton never met a blood thirsty war she didn't like, she so bought and payed for by wall street, their brand is seared into the tattered remains of her soul.<br /> <br /> And she hates men, hardcore, she wants to lighten sentances on women even though they serve a fraction of the time for the same offence that men do and are small fraction of the imprisoned already, but she also wants to punish men more severally then they already do.<br /> <br /> I did support Bernie, he was good for North America.<br /> <br /> So you can stick your lying, dishonest smears of Bernie Sanders supporters were sun doesn't shine, because my record of supporting women in politics is much better then your, I have long term track record to back it up, you American do not.<br /> <br /> That Clinton supporters have to lie and smear people instead of relying on Hillary's track record says all you need to know about Hillary and her lack of substance.<br /> <br /> America fucked up big time saying no to Bernie Sanders.<br /> <br /> Now you end up with Trump or Hillary, what a disaster.<br /> <br /> I so for getting serious for a moment, but I'm tired of seeing Sanders supporters smeared.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T04:55:39-07:00","id":921434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/911713-just-for-fun-donald-trump-as-every-supernatural-splat?p=921412#post921412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I so for getting serious for a moment, but I'm tired of seeing Sanders supporters smeared.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, so you smear me instead. Actually, you don't do that at all, you conveniently attack my country rather than confront me directly.<br /> <br /> I am not kidding about at least some Bernie supporters being frankly loathsome people. Many are not. There's at least a few frankly loathsome people in my camp, though I'd dare say there's less. The general reaction of Obama getting the nomination was eventually everyone shrugging and voting for him-which to be fair, seems to be the general reaction of the sane parts of the Sanders vote.<br /> <br /> But Omega, here's my honest opinion of the matter:<br /> <br /> <i>Bernie is the Democratic version of Trump.</i><br /> <br /> This already means he's a significantly better person than Trump (we have less megalomania in our crazy), but when it comes down to it, he was tapping into the exact same worker's malaise-that doesn't make him a bad person in and of itself, but the fact his policy plans are at best &quot;vague&quot; and at worst &quot;self-destruct. That oh-so-wonderful college plan? Yeah, I've talked to people, and found it would have bankrupted the nation.<br /> <br /> &quot;Okay,&quot; you may say, &quot;he had a few bad policies, he can change those on contact with reality.&quot; But the thing is, he was also running on having better moral character than his opponents-and for me, that was something that failed <i>hard. </i>For one thing, when his supporters started something of a riot at their own party's convention to whine at Hillary, he didn't do the moral thing and condemn the people who thought it was a great idea to to start shitting on the dignity and more importantly <i>chances </i>of the party, instead making a mealy-mouthed deflection. When things didn't go his way and he started losing the popular vote, he suddenly switched from superdelegates being a tool of the elite to suddenly them being the savior of the party and focused everything he had into twisting the system he was running against because it was too easy to twist the system. And now we have this whole debacle about him not endorsing the actual presumptive candidate-because he wants to wring a cabinet position out of her. I am not kidding, he actually said that. I think it isn't remiss to say that is outright illegal (I'd also be a little more forgiving, except he let slip that he is voting for her and then spent the next day confirming that is isn't actually <i>endorsing </i>her &quot;just yet.&quot; That strikes me as being a more typical politician than most actual politicians).<br /> <br /> Now, over to Hillary, and your two criticisms (freaking everyone who has had more than one term in office can be accused of being brought by Wall Street-it's a hollow flail). I won't lie, she's an interventionist, which is a nicer way of saying &quot;warhawk.&quot; But she's a <i>smart </i>warhawk-she gets involved in wars to build countries, not to topple the enemy. Which means she considers whether or not the country is ready for a war first-which we apparently were before Iraq, hence why she made a vote she has gone on record she says she deeply regrets. &quot;Hates men&quot; however-I desperately don't want to confront that criticism, on the basis it is the kind of pure bunk that absolutely nobody who hawks it really <i>wants </i>to be convinced otherwise. &quot;Hates men&quot; is generally code for &quot;hates rape culture and is vocal and effective about it.&quot; Which is frankly what we need in a nation where a convicted rapist can serve a quarter of the minimum term because the judge thinks &quot;we'd ruin a strapping young (white) man's future&quot; (thank god the sport isn't so far up its own ass-he got his privilege to compete revoked). Women may serve a quarter of the time, but that's small comfort in a nation where they still get paid less, are allowed to do less, and to be frank are treated more like toys than people-up to and including the fact that many still view them as property. If the men responsible for their misery are treated with the gloves off, I'll be there to hold said gloves.<br /> <br /> Above all else, you seem to have missed the fact that Bernie did indeed do what he probably originally intended, and pulled her to the left-and she's <i>stayed </i>there. Fun fact; her platform is almost exactly like Bernie's. And statistically, she's not lying; I read somewhere that, if elected, politicians keep at least 70% of their running platform, on average. Yes, this means that politicians generally want to be honest, and thus goes against &quot;common sense.&quot; &quot;Common sense&quot;, when dealing with all but the most mundane, is empty, senseless drivel. Deal with it.<br /> <br /> Maybe she'll be bad. Maybe, more likely, she'll be Obama 2.0, possibly with a House not composed of the political equivalent of a brain tumor and a party who finally has no fucks to give to a spineless opponent held in terror of a base they themselves have forged deliberately and slowly out of racism, sexism, and xenophobia. But even if she does turn out to be the female version of Julius Caesar, I'd rather have a militarist than Caligula, come November. And better her than a man who, as far as I can tell, <i>is </i>a liar who claims to be otherwise.<br /> <br /> (And if the word &quot;email server&quot; is mentioned, that will go unresponded and ignored-fun fact, the more we learn of that &quot;scandal&quot;, the more we learn how <i>legal </i>it was. It was an office kerfuffle that generally leads to someone not getting their bonus this month, not some malignant scheme to leave classified documents on a table for...someone).<br /> <br /> (Wow, we are getting off topic)<br /> <br /> Edit: And I just remembered something: it's Bill Clinton who was the neoliberal. Hillary herself, once back in the Senate, advocated strict regulation of Wall Street. So even neoliberal is a smear against her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":".  Suddenly realized poor word choice. My bad. 06-26-2016, 10:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T08:01:35-07:00","id":921489,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Thread closed. We'll be discussing the group attacks too, so don't be surprised if some suspensions are issued.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\